# Build context: only what the Dockerfile copies (Cargo files, build.rs, src
# and the build script of ik_llama.cpp). The toolchain file stays out: the builder image pins the
# same Rust version, and rustup would otherwise download extra components.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src/
!scripts/build-ik-llama.sh
